es."}], "trade": {"legs": [{"instrument": "DGS2", "weight": -0.2}, {"instrument": "DGS10", "weight": -0.25}], "conviction": 0.3, "rationale": "Modest, low-conviction long-duration bet: fresh balance-sheet read and stale-but-consistent inflation call both lean toward slightly lower yields; size kept small given overall panel flatness."}}

