itioning", "text": "Excluded positioning/risk-appetite data could mask crowding that amplifies or dampens the actual yield move."}], "trade": {"legs": [{"instrument": "DGS2", "weight": 0.4}, {"instrument": "DGS10", "weight": 0.6}], "conviction": 0.55, "rationale": "Net level-up view from balance sheet runoff and rising term premium, tilted longer-duration since term premium is the fresher, stronger driver."}}

